oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file Makefile kept 9
| O = base
| override O$+= x
| E2 = base
| export E2$:= y
| P = base
| P$$$:= v
| all:
| 	@printf '%s\n' 'O=$(O)/$(flavor O)' 'E2=$(E2)/$(flavor E2)' \
| 	  'Pdollar=$(P$)/$(flavor P$)' 'P=$(P)' > out
file out touched 4
| O=x/recursive
| E2=y/recursive
| Pdollar=v/recursive
| P=base
